  "about": {
    "tag": "// CREATIVE BIOGRAPHY & ETHOS",
    "headline": "CRAFTING VISUAL LEGACIES FOR CINEMA & CULTURE.",
    "profileImage": "/starter_assets/ZaApBaIfuKVadeqET6B3KEc3ZGI.png",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "I am Muthu â€” a specialized Film Poster Designer and Key Art Specialist based in India. For over 8 years, I have collaborated with premier film production houses, visionary directors, and major entertainment brands to conceive, design, and execute unforgettable visual identities for cinema.",
      "My creative philosophy fuses classical typographical discipline with contemporary cinematic lighting, deep atmospheric textures, and emotional character narratives. Every key visual is crafted to command attention on massive theatrical hoardings, international film festival circuits, and high-density digital streams.",
      "From gritty indie triumphs to massive commercial blockbusters, I treat every poster as an enduring piece of art that crystallizes the film's soul before the projector ever turns on."
    ],
